ns (range, terminal velocity, impact angle).&#10;</div><div>o&#9;Participate in the dispersion analysis of unguided systems.&#10;</div><div><b><i>&#8226;&#9;Modeling of Dynamic Systems:&#10;</i></b></div><div>o&#9;Learn and apply 6 DOF dynamics and kinematics modeling in MATLAB &amp; Simulink, utilizing the aerospace block set and control system toolbox.&#10;</div><div>o&#9;Assist in modeling environmental disturbances such as wind, thrust misalignments, and center of gravity (CG) offsets.&#10;</div><div><b><i>&#8226;&#9;Development of Guidance Schemes (Support Role):&#10;</i></b></div><div>o&#9;Support the design and analysis of fundamental guidance schemes (e.g., Proportional Navigation (PN)) to meet mission requirements.&#10;</div><div>o&#9;Assist in trajectory shaping analysis for guided systems.&#10;</div><div><i><b>&#8226;&#9;Designing of Control Systems (Support Role):&#10;</b></i></div><div>o&#9;Assist in autopilot design using classical control methods.&#10;</div><div>o&#9;Learn to linearize dynamic systems to design autopilots using transfer function models.&#10;</div><div>o&#9;Participate in analyzing control system performance and stability using tools like Bode and Nyquist Plots.&#10;</div><div>o&#9;Support Hardware-in-the-Loop (HIL) and Software-in-the-Loop (SIL) simulations.&#10;</div><div><b><i>&#8226;&#9;Perturbation Analysis (Support Role):&#10;</i></b></div><div>o&#9;Assist with sensitivity analysis of various parameters.&#10;</div><div>o&#9;Support Monte Carlo simulations to analyze performance within permissible perturbation bands.</div>","additional_details":null,"is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Solar Industries India Limited","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":10579,"created_by_name":"Akshay Pandey","updated_by":8525,"created_at"